OL,3,GNEWSAOffice block could be converted
OL,4,Ainto housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision to convert business premises
OL,7,Finto more than 100 new affordable homes
OL,8,Fwill be made by the end of November,
OL,9,Faccording to Wokingham Borough Council.
OL,11,FIf approved, Mulberry Business Park in
OL,12,FWokingham would house residents such as
OL,13,Fthose at risk of homelessness, care
OL,14,Fleavers, people with physical
OL,15,Fdisabilities and local families.
OL,17,FThe site, which was bought by the
OL,18,Fcouncil in 2018, is loss-making due to
OL,19,Flow demand for office space and costs
OL,20,Fthe authority more than #800,000 a
OL,21,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
